\f0\fs24 \cf0 ##############Folder overview##############\
Each experiment has its own folder and each folder contains the following subfolders:\
\
1. [The code folder] Codes for cleaning the raw data and performing the analyses + visualization in the manuscript.\
2. [The data_raw_primary folder] Raw and primary data directed downloaded from Pavlovia and Qualtrics. These are the first, unaltered version of the experiment data. The cleaning_[experiment index]. The data cleaning script (cleaning_[experiment index].R) can be run to convert these raw data into a cleaned version for further analyses.\
3. [The data_clean folder] Cleaned data. For the Pilot Experiment and Experiments 1a, 1b, and 2, there are two separate files for the empathy and PIT analyses; for Experiment 3 there is only one file.\
4. [The study materials folder] The original study materials, including the PsychoPy task (which is used to create the Pavlovia project) and the exported Qualtrics survey(s).\
